<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <RootNamespace>Microsoft.VisualBasic.Drawing</RootNamespace>
    <TargetFrameworks>net10.0-windows</TargetFrameworks>
    <UseApplicationFramework>True</UseApplicationFramework>
    <AssemblyName>Microsoft.VisualBasic.Drawing.Windows</AssemblyName>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <Platforms>AnyCPU;x64</Platforms>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <PackageId>Microsoft.VisualBasic.Drawing.Windows</PackageId>
    <Title>GDI+ Graphics Wrapper And System.Drawing Interop For Windows</Title>
    <Authors>xieguigang &lt;I@xieguigang.me&gt;</Authors>
    <Company>sciBASIC.NET Foundation</Company>
    <Product>scibasic.net</Product>
    <Configurations>Debug;Release;nuget_release;Rsharp_app_release;MEMI-Desktop;CellaLAB-Desktop</Configurations>
    <Description>A Windows-only GDI+ canvas, image filter, GIF/TIFF encoder and font-metrics wrapper with converters that bridge sciBASIC# graphics models to System.Drawing, providing the GDI raster back end of the driver based graphics engine.</Description>
    <AssemblyTitle>Microsoft.VisualBasic.Drawing</AssemblyTitle>
    <ApplicationIcon>sciBASIC#.ico</ApplicationIcon>
    <PackageIcon>logo-knot.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageProjectUrl>http://scibasic.net/</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/xieguigang/sciBASIC</RepositoryUrl>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) sciBASIC.NET Foundation</Copyright>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageTags>scibasic;gdi-plus;system-drawing;graphics-interop;windows-forms;gif-encoder;tiff;font-metrics</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>The Windows GDI+ back end of the sciBASIC# graphics engine. Canvas: the Graphics namespace wraps a GDI+ drawing surface (GDICanvas, Graphics2D and Wmf) with a CSS interop bridge, so rendering code written against the driver based IGraphics API can target GDI+ unchanged. Encoders: the FileEncoder namespace provides the GIF and TIFF writers together with the image format enumeration. Interop: the Interop namespace holds the P/Invoke bindings and managed images (GDIPlusInterop, GDIPlusImage, DrawingInterop and BitmapBuffer) that marshal between sciBASIC# graphics models and System.Drawing types. Images and filters: Imager and the Filters namespace (Effects, ImageExtensions and Utils) apply bitmap effects inside the same pipeline. Text: the Text namespace provides font metrics (FontMetrics), graphics text drawing and the text layout model. The project targets the .NET Framework and is therefore Windows only.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>GPL-3.0-or-later</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <Version>1.0.9762.11310</Version>
    <AssemblyVersion>1.0.9762.11310</AssemblyVersion>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <IncludeSymbols>True</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Debug|AnyCPU'">
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>True</RemoveIntegerChecks>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Debug|x64'">
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>True</RemoveIntegerChecks>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Release|AnyCPU'">
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>True</RemoveIntegerChecks>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='MEMI-Desktop|AnyCPU'">
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>True</RemoveIntegerChecks>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='nuget_release|AnyCPU'">
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>True</RemoveIntegerChecks>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Rsharp_app_release|AnyCPU'">
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>True</RemoveIntegerChecks>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='CellaLAB-Desktop|AnyCPU'">
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>True</RemoveIntegerChecks>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Release|x64'">
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>True</RemoveIntegerChecks>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='MEMI-Desktop|x64'">
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>True</RemoveIntegerChecks>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='nuget_release|x64'">
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>True</RemoveIntegerChecks>
    <OutputPath>../../.nuget/</OutputPath>
    <PlatformTarget>x64</PlatformTarget>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Rsharp_app_release|x64'">
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>True</RemoveIntegerChecks>
    <OutputPath>../../.nuget/</OutputPath>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='CellaLAB-Desktop|x64'">
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>True</RemoveIntegerChecks>
    <OutputPath>../../.nuget/</OutputPath>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Remove="HtmlRender\**" />
    <EmbeddedResource Remove="HtmlRender\**" />
    <None Remove="HtmlRender\**" />
    <None Include="README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Content Include="sciBASIC#.ico" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\vs_solutions\logo-knot.png">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="System.Drawing.Common" Version="10.0.12" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\Data_science\Mathematica\Math\Math\Math.NET5.vbproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\Microsoft.VisualBasic.Core\src\Core.vbproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\mime\text%html\html_netcore5.vbproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
